    | label x1 x2 => label (F x1 leaf) (F x2 t)
    | leaf => t
    | legend x1 x2 => legend (F x1 leaf) (F x2 t)
    | li x1 x2 => li (F x1 leaf) (F x2 t)
    | link x1 x2 => link (F x1 leaf) (F x2 t)
